: 380150.3551001, "t_first_token_s": 380150.3551001, "t_start_s": 380150.2518429, "text": "Generation splits into two phases: prefill and decode. Prefill has unrelated performance characteristics because it saturates the arithmetic units and draws power close to the board limit, whereas decode leaves most of the arithmetic units idle while the memory subsystem is pushed hard. This means that a configuration that wins on prefill may lose on decode, and vice versa.", "total_duration_ns": 740832200, "ttft_s": 0.10325719998218119, "valid": true}
